        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Question"><strong>Can a shorter option fill the gap?</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Why it matters">Certificates and projects cost less</td>
          <td data-label="What a good answer looks like">A comparison of two options</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Question"><strong>Who will hire me after?</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Why it matters">Placement claims vary</td>
          <td data-label="What a good answer looks like">Names of recent employers from past students</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Question"><strong>How will I explain my break?</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Why it matters">Interviewers will ask</td>
          <td data-label="What a good answer looks like">A calm, honest two-line answer</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="story">A calm two-line answer for the gap</h2>

  <div class="table-wrap">
