        <tr>
          <td data-label="Reason"><strong>Family care</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Example wording">I took time to care for family and have been preparing to return</td>
          <td data-label="Then add">A recent skill or project</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Reason"><strong>Health recovery</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Example wording">I took time away and am now ready to work full time</td>
          <td data-label="Then add">A readiness line, no medical details required</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Reason"><strong>Study or exams</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Example wording">I spent the time preparing for exams and learning new skills</td>
          <td data-label="Then add">The skills and proof</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Reason"><strong>Business attempt</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Example wording">I tried a venture and learned about customers and cash</td>
          <td data-label="Then add">One lesson and a result</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    You choose what to share. Keep the answer short and move to what you can do now.
  </p>

  <h2 id="bridge">A twelve-week bridge to test your plan before paying MBA fees</h2>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table paths-table--wide">
